  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Goal:\nBeat the dealer by getting a hand closer to 21 than the dealer
    without going over.\n\nCard Values:\n    Number cards (2\u201310) = their number\n
    Face cards (J, Q, K) = 10\n    Aces = 1 or 11 (whichever is better for your hand)\n\nHow
    a Round Works:\n    \nYou and the dealer are both dealt cards.\n\u2022    You
    see all of your cards.\n\u2022    The dealer shows one card face-up and one hidden
    (shown as something like \"Face + ?\").\nOn your turn you choose:\n\u2022 Hit
    \u2013 draw another card.\n\u2022    Stand \u2013 stop drawing cards and lock
    in your total.\nIf your total goes over 21, you bust and automatically lose the
    round.\nAfter you stand, the dealer plays:\n\u2022 The dealer reveals the hidden
    card.\n\u2022    The dealer draws according to the house rules you used and dealer
    hits till 17.\nAt the end:\n\u2022    Higher total \u2264 21 wins.\n\u2022 Ties/Push
    do not earn wins.\n\nMatch / First-to-5:\n    \u2022    Each round, the winner
    gets 1 point.\n    \u2022    The first to reach 5 points wins the match.\n \u2022
    When someone hits 5, the minigame ends."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67667796e1ee0704185fa792acf0bb64, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -5693713142466329080, guid: 67667796e1ee0704185fa792acf0bb64, type: 2}
