  m_text: The King's Jester. He is a young, but mysterious talent even without the
    improvements modern day steampunk augmentations would provide him. No one knows
    his background, and he speaks none of it. He only refers to himself as a story
    teller through music with his trusty acoustic guitar. He joined the King's court
    through a contest of wit and song, defeating every bard and satirist until only
    his voice remained in the hall. Now he stands by his side as an entertainer,
    story teller and an insightful neutral character.
