  m_text: 'Use the movement keys (arrow keys / WASD) to move the player one tile
    at a time.


    Walk into a box to push it. You can only push one box at a time.


    You
    cannot pull boxes or walk through walls.


    Your goal is to push all boxes
    onto the target tiles (marked spots).


    When every target has a box on it,
    the level is complete.


    Use the Reset button if you get stuck and want to
    restart the puzzle.'
